                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c4bf6158-a6d6-3d66-b75b-d4becfec04c9",
                        "entry_id": "7e4e1d4a-1687-38b3-b0e5-3e829264640b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "tesching (bird hunter's rifle of a small caliber produced in Cieszyn)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f07ac6e0-2ffe-40f3-b8c7-66c840be3d64",
                                "sense_id": "c4bf6158-a6d6-3d66-b75b-d4becfec04c9",
                                "text": "Autorka uznaje za mało prawdopodobne twierdzenie niektórych bronioznawców, wywodzących cieszynkę od kaukaskiej „czeczenki”.",
                                "translation": "The author considered this an unlikely claim of some gun experts, originating the tesching from the Kaukaski czeczenka.",
                                "english": "The author considered this an unlikely claim of some gun experts, originating the tesching from the Kaukaski czeczenka."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "92a4ede1-0ab6-4baf-b5f8-47da9ffc674e",
                                "sense_id": "c4bf6158-a6d6-3d66-b75b-d4becfec04c9",
                                "text": "Byłoby jednak niesłuszne uważać cieszynkę za dorobek wyłącznie rusznikarstwa polskiego. Trzeba jeszcze dodać, że pewien wariant ptaszniczki w typie cieszynki produkowany był w Rosji.",
                                "translation": "It would be, however, unjust to consider the tesching a work of exclusively Polish gunsmithing. It should be added that a certain variant of birding gun similar to a tesching was produced in Russia.",
                                "english": "It would be, however, unjust to consider the tesching a work of exclusively Polish gunsmithing. It should be added that a certain variant of birding gun similar to a tesching was produced in Russia."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "68933ec2-9fcb-4cbd-b28a-c0f2929c0185",
                                "sense_id": "c4bf6158-a6d6-3d66-b75b-d4becfec04c9",
                                "text": "Wtedy zbójcy zabrali go do lasu, tam ubrali „po góralsku”, dali parę pistoletów, strzelbę (cieszynkę) i kazali iść po gorzałkę.",
                                "translation": "Then the brigands took him to the woods, dressed him up in mountain folk garb, gave him a pair of pistols, a rifle (a tesching), and told him to go get the hooch.",
                                "english": "Then the brigands took him to the woods, dressed him up in mountain folk garb, gave him a pair of pistols, a rifle (a tesching), and told him to go get the hooch."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cf8a120f-a3ff-312d-81b0-2e66d37b43dd",
                        "entry_id": "7e4e1d4a-1687-38b3-b0e5-3e829264640b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Teshenas disease"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "83eea9b5-65e6-4224-b3c2-12fc6ba156b2",
                                "sense_id": "cf8a120f-a3ff-312d-81b0-2e66d37b43dd",
                                "text": "Wyniki podanych wyżej obserwacji nad odpornością świni puławskiej na „cieszynkę\", skłoniły w ostatnim czasie Komisariat do walki z tą chorobą do przedstawienia wniosku w Min. R. i R. R. o modyfikację planu rejonizacyjnego hodowli trzody chlewnej w okręgu cieszyńskim - w tym sensie, by pas pograniczny nasilić rasą puławską.",
                                "translation": "The results of the above given observations on Puławian pigs and their immunity to \"Teshenas disease\" prompted the Police Station to fight with this disease to submit a request at Min. R. i R. R. to modify the regionalization plan to breed swine in the Cieszyń region - in this way to intensify the borderland belt with the Pulawian breed.",
                                "english": "The results of the above given observations on Puławian pigs and their immunity to \"Teshenas disease\" prompted the Police Station to fight with this disease to submit a request at Min. R. i R. R. to modify the regionalization plan to breed swine in the Cieszyń region - in this way to intensify the borderland belt with the Pulawian breed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3e47512-dde4-4373-ac47-ed009d4db6be",
                                "sense_id": "cf8a120f-a3ff-312d-81b0-2e66d37b43dd",
                                "text": "Przed ustaleniem rozpoznania przez pracownię podejrzewano intoksykację pokarmową związaną ze zmianą karmy, dyzenterię świń, listeriozę, leptospirozę, salmonelozę, cieszynkę, pomór i otrucie.",
                                "translation": "Before the workshop determines [the cause], food poisoning related with a change in diet, pig's dysentery, listeriosis, salmonellosis, Teshenas disease, pestilence, and poison are suspected.",
                                "english": "Before the workshop determines [the cause], food poisoning related with a change in diet, pig's dysentery, listeriosis, salmonellosis, Teshenas disease, pestilence, and poison are suspected."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
